+// (including the process-global default stream) is visible from every thread,
+// so concurrent eval_impl calls could race the same encoder into a Metal
+// assertion (SIGABRT). The pmetal consumer contract is "single eval thread /
+// batch-dimension concurrency" (inference gen-core runtime.rs, schedule.rs);
